# TanStack Query — queryOptions 팩토리 패턴

커스텀 훅(`useOrders`)으로 감싸지 않는다. `queryOptions()` 기반 팩토리 객체를 `lib/api/@queries/`에 도메인별로 만든다.

```ts
// lib/api/@queries/orders.ts
export const orderQueries = {
  all:     () => ['orders'] as const,
  lists:   () => [...orderQueries.all(), 'list'] as const,
  list:    (params: GetOrdersParams) => queryOptions({
    queryKey: [...orderQueries.lists(), params],
    queryFn: () => getOrders(params),
    staleTime: 30_000,
  }),
  details: () => [...orderQueries.all(), 'detail'] as const,
  detail:  (id: string) => queryOptions({
    queryKey: [...orderQueries.details(), id],
    queryFn: () => getOrderDetail(id),
    staleTime: 60_000,
  }),
}
```

컴포넌트에서 직접 사용:

```ts
useQuery(orderQueries.list(params))
useSuspenseQuery(orderQueries.detail(id))
queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: orderQueries.lists() })
```
